      "content": "TL 10 SW                    ST STEPHEN           SEARCHES LANE                                                  (north side) 12/343                                           Barn at Searches Farm GV                                               II Barn.   C18.   Long  weatherboarded range  bounding N  side  of farmyard.  Plain tile roof.  10 bays.  N side has 1 gabled cart entrance.  SW side has late C18/early C19 red brick extension with dentilled brick eaves and hipped roof.  Interior of main barn has 2 threshing floors E and W of centre. Listing NGR: TL1134903451"
    }
